blocks.en:
For the segmentation task, we append a four-layer segmentation head MLP seg \mathrm{MLP}_{\text{seg}} on top of the pretrained BRepA encoder and fine-tune the entire model.
We compare BRepA with the following baselines:
(1) UV-Net : the official model and default configuration from [ 15 ] ;
(2) UV-Net++ : an enlarged version of UV-Net with the same parameter count as BRepA, trained for the same number of epochs as BRepA’s pretraining & finetuning;
(3) UV-Net++ w/ SDF SSL : the UV-Net++ baseline further pretrained with the SDF reconstruction objective proposed in [ 17 ] ;
(4) BRepA (w/o SSL) : BRepA with MLP seg \mathrm{MLP}_{\text{seg}} but trained from scratch without any pretraining;
(5) BRepA (w/ only geo. MAE) : BRepA pretrained only with the geometric MAE objective.

blocks.zh:
对于分解任务,我们附加一个四层分解头 MLP seg \mathrm{MLP}_{\text{seg}} 在预训的 BrepA 编码器上方,并对整个模型进行微调.
我们比较BREPA与下列基线:
(1) UV-Net:官方模式和从[15]起的默认配置;
(2) UV-Net++:一个与BREPA相同的参数计数的UV-Net扩展版,为BREPA的预训和微调相同的时代训练;
(3) UV-Net++ w/ SDF SSL:UV-Net++ 基线与[17]中提议的SDF重建目标进一步预先调整;
(4) BREPA (w/o SSL): 使用 MLP seg 的 BrepA 组合为\ mathrm{ MLP}_{\text{ seg}}} 但从零开始训练, 没有任何预训 ;
(5) BREPA(w/只取地语. 马恩: BREPA只预训了几何MAE目标.
